{
  "id": "provost.who_comes",
  "sender": "provost",
  "type": "request",
  "skippable": false,
  "body": [
    {
      "text": "You will forgive a long letter at the outset. It is the first of two, and between them they settle matters that are very difficult to settle later."
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a colony now, which means there is a question of who comes to it. Three parts of that question are below. I have put each as a single line, being told the post is heavy."
    },
    {
      "text": "I shall say at the start that I will ask for more of all of them than you will want to give, and that I shall go on asking. I would rather tell you that now than have you work it out."
    }
  ],
  "reply": {
    "tone": {
      "text": "Dr Meakin — I have read your letter and am {choice}.",
      "options": [
        {
          "tone": "dutiful",
          "text": "minded to settle it properly"
        },
        {
          "tone": "pleased",
          "text": "glad of the thoroughness"
        },
        {
          "tone": "annoyed",
          "text": "conscious of its length"
        }
      ]
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "volume",
        "prompt": "How many come at all",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "volume_none",
            "label": "none",
            "text": "No encouragement. The colony will grow by what it is, or not at all.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_volume",
                "cost": 0,
                "split": "none",
                "level": "nothing"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "volume_little",
            "label": "a little",
            "text": "A little encouragement, and no more than a little.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_volume",
                "cost": 79,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_little"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "volume_lot",
            "label": "a lot",
            "text": "Encourage them properly. I would rather have the hands.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_volume",
                "cost": 158,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_lot"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "volume_great",
            "label": "a great deal",
            "text": "Fill it. Whatever it costs, fill it.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_volume",
                "cost": 240,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_great_deal"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "provision",
        "prompt": "What they bring with them",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "provision_none",
            "label": "nothing",
            "text": "They may bring what they can carry.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_provision",
                "cost": 0,
                "split": "none",
                "level": "nothing"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "provision_little",
            "label": "a little",
            "text": "See that they are not destitute when they land.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_provision",
                "cost": 66,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_little"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "provision_lot",
            "label": "a lot",
            "text": "Supply them well. A settler who lands with nothing is a settler the town must feed.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_provision",
                "cost": 132,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_lot"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "provision_great",
            "label": "a great deal",
            "text": "Send them out equipped for a country none of them has seen.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_provision",
                "cost": 200,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_great_deal"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "experts",
        "prompt": "How many of them know a trade",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "experts_none",
            "label": "none",
            "text": "Hands will do. We are not founding a university.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_experts",
                "cost": 0,
                "split": "none",
                "level": "nothing"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "experts_little",
            "label": "a little",
            "text": "A few who know something, where they can be had.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_experts",
                "cost": 99,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_little"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "experts_lot",
            "label": "a lot",
            "text": "Seek out the skilled. One of them is worth several of the others.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_experts",
                "cost": 198,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_lot"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "experts_great",
            "label": "a great deal",
            "text": "The best men you can find, and outbid whoever else is bidding.",
            "effect": {
              "set_knob": {
                "to": "provost",
                "effect": "immigration_experts",
                "cost": 300,
                "split": "all",
                "level": "a_great_deal"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "closing": [
      {
        "text": "I am, sir, your obedient servant,"
      }
    ]
  }
}
